WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.293 --> 00:00:04.087
Josh, you've been homeschooled
your whole life.

00:00:04.171 --> 00:00:06.256
So public school
is going to be challenging.

00:00:06.632 --> 00:00:07.466
Here we go.

00:00:10.636 --> 00:00:11.470
Oh, uh, guys...

00:00:11.845 --> 00:00:13.722
If the leg is the first thing
kids know about me,

00:00:13.805 --> 00:00:15.140
that's all they'll care about.

00:00:15.224 --> 00:00:18.060
I wanna make friends because they like me,
not because they feel bad for me.

00:00:18.143 --> 00:00:20.604
Just take my advice.
Lay low for a little while.

00:00:20.979 --> 00:00:21.980
What's homeschool like?

00:00:22.064 --> 00:00:24.525
It's basically a vanilla-scented prison.

00:00:26.109 --> 00:00:26.944
He's a legend.

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:30.197
There's so much to do.
I mean, so much to try.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:31.949
I don't wanna miss any of it.

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:33.909
Do you want to sneak soda into a movie?

00:00:38.121 --> 00:00:39.790
-How'd it go?
-It was good.

00:00:40.791 --> 00:00:41.834
Mostly good.

00:00:41.917 --> 00:00:43.085
Let me tell your mom about this.

00:00:43.168 --> 00:00:44.253
We just gotta find the right time.

00:00:45.003 --> 00:00:46.505
Ooh, secrets.

00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:49.883
Things are changing.

00:00:49.967 --> 00:00:50.884
There is no going back.

00:00:51.718 --> 00:00:54.596
You've always inspired me
to never back down from a challenge.

00:00:59.268 --> 00:01:01.603
If you don't diversify
your extra-curriculars early,

00:01:01.687 --> 00:01:02.646
you're toast.

00:01:02.980 --> 00:01:04.731
-Josh Dubin.
-Here.

00:01:05.357 --> 00:01:06.191
Here.

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:09.444
Here!

